-- one step of the machine's process is one step of the machine: the view of its tree is the
-- machine's view with the process of the next state in place of the state (a silent step is
-- not a step of the process: it continues at once)
nview-map : {M X Y : Type} → (X → Y) → NView M X → NView M Y
nview-map f v = case v of v-halt → v-halt; v-send to m s → v-send to m (f s); v-recv k → v-recv (λ r → f (k r)); v-now kn → v-now (λ w → f (kn w)); v-tau s → v-tau (f s)
